;; Type System Test: dropping a qubit without using it is a compile-time error
;; EXPECT-MODE: default
;; EXPECT-COMPILE: fail
;; EXPECT-STDERR: linear variable 'q' was not consumed

;; "Use exactly once" has two halves. Discarding a linear resource is the other
;; one, and it is fatal in the default mode for the same reason cloning is.
(define (bad-drop (q : Qubit))
  42)
